ed here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ring}_S,\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ring}_S,\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}over\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgAlgebraOverRing}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\eta)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ring}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A)\\land \\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\land \\operatorname{Function}(\\eta,R,A)\\land\\eta(0_R)=0_A\\land\\eta(1_R)=1_A\\land\\forall r,s\\in R\\;\\left(\\eta(r+_Rs)=\\eta(r)+_A\\eta(s)\\land\\eta(r\\cdot_Rs)=\\eta(r)\\cdot_A\\eta(s)\\right)\\land \\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\eta(r)\\cdot_A a=a\\cdot_A\\eta(r))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}alg\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}over\\text{-}ring} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgAlgebraOverRing}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,\\eta)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{Ring}_S(A,+_A,\\cdot_A,0_A,1_A)\\land \\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R)\\land \\operatorname{Function}(\\eta,R,A)\\land\\eta(0_R)=0_A\\land\\eta(1_R)=1_A\\land\\forall r,s\\in R\\;\\left(\\eta(r+_Rs)=\\eta(r)+_A\\eta(s)\\land\\eta(r\\cdot_Rs)=\\eta(r)\\cdot_A\\eta(s)\\right)\\land \\forall r\\in R\\;\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\eta(r)\\cdot_A a=a\\cdot_A\\eta(r))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-algebra structure on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is a unital ring homomorphism <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta:R\\to A\">\\(\\eta:R\\to A\\)</span> whose image lies in the center of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Ring}_S,\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":